{"name":"头像","description":"头像是用于识别用户、团队或组织的图像、首字或标志组件 · 成员列表和评论区可用头像帮助快速认人。应同时展示姓名，不能只靠头像辨认身份；使用照片还要尊重隐私设置。","quote":"评论区得看到是谁在说话，带上头像。","agentPrompt":"请让评论作者始终显示头像和姓名；没有图片或加载失败时，用姓名首字作为兜底，但不要隐藏姓名。用相同首字、相似头像和超长姓名分别验证身份仍可区分。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-avatar\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>头像<span>Avatar</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">评论区得看到是谁在说话，带上头像。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">头像是用于识别用户、团队或组织的图像、首字或标志组件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>成员列表和评论区可用头像帮助快速认人。应同时展示姓名，不能只靠头像辨认身份；使用照片还要尊重隐私设置。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><span class=\"avatar-d lg\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></span>\n  <span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#165dff\">林</span>\n  <span class=\"avatar-d square\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-robot.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></span>\n  <span class=\"avatar-group-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d sm\" style=\"background:#165dff\">林</span><span class=\"avatar-d sm\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">油</span><span class=\"avatar-d sm\" style=\"background:#626c7a\">+5</span></span></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请让评论作者始终显示头像和姓名；没有图片或加载失败时，用姓名首字作为兜底，但不要隐藏姓名。用相同首字、相似头像和超长姓名分别验证身份仍可区分。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"ha