center;justify-content:center;flex:none;border:1.5px solid #fff\">B</span><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#287947;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;border:1.5px solid #fff\">C</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">只有头像没有姓名，无法辨认成员</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">圆形展示的风景图或插画仍属于 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/image?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"image\" aria-label=\"图片 Image\">图片 <b>Image</b></a>，不应当作头像</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#165dff,#722ed1);display:inline-block;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">横向插画裁成圆形后，主体两侧被截断</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>证件照</b>要完整信息，圆形裁切会裁掉关键部分</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px dashed var(--red);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--red);flex:none\">脸</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.5\">证件照被圆形裁掉半张脸</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">同一屏<b>反复出现同一个人</b>的大头像</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#165dff;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none\">我</span><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">我的主页</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:#165dff;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none\">我</span><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">我的文章</