/avatar-robot.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">代表团队、应用等非个人对象</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">多尺寸<span>Sizes</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"avatar-d lg\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">油</span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">油</span><span class=\"avatar-d sm\" style=\"background:#722ed1\">油</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">按信息层级区分尺寸，例如个人中心使用较大头像，评论区使用较小头像</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">头像组<span>Group</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"avatar-group-d\"><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#165dff\">林</span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-robot.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></span><span class=\"avatar-d\" style=\"background:#626c7a\">+5</span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">展示参与者范围，并提供完整名单入口</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">评论区</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:8px\">全部评论 (2)</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <span class=\"avatar-d sm\" style=\"background:url(&#x27;/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png&#x27;) center/cover\"></span>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">林小hu</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">2 分钟前</span></div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px\">评论内容示例</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:fle